<title>USA: AVAX Technologies to trade on Nasdaq.</title>
<headline>AVAX Technologies to trade on Nasdaq.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>AVAX Technologies Inc, a development stage biopharmaceutical company, said its shares will begin trading on the Nasdaq SmallCap Market Thursday.</p>
<p>The company also said its registration statement for the resale of up to 7.0 million shares by certain shareholders of the company was declared affective.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
